      "rev_n_1_fe8d23_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_fe8d23_0",
        "node_id": "n_1_fe8d23",
        "thought_text": "Calculate the trajectory of each corner of the cookie independently using the given initial velocity, angle, and angular velocity. Determine the time it takes for each corner to reach the wall by solving the quadratic equation derived from the parabolic motion formula. Compare these times to find the earliest collision.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794409108.155914
      },
      "rev_n_2_67b423_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_67b423_0",
        "node_id": "n_2_67b423",
        "thought_text": "Simulate the motion of the cookie in small time steps. At each step, update the positions of all corners based on the current velocity and rotation. Check if any corner has crossed the wall's x-coordinate. Stop the simulation once the first corner hits the wall and record the time.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794409108.155937
      },
      "rev_n_3_c8929d_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_c8929d_0",
        "node_id": "n_3_c8929d",
        "thought_text": "Transform the coordinate system such that the wall is vertical and aligned with the y-axis. This simplifies the problem to finding the intersection of each corner's path (a rotated parabola) with the y-axis. Calculate the time of intersection for each corner and select the minimum.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794409108.155942
      },
      "rev_n_4_859917_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_4_859917_0",
        "node_id": "n_4_859917",
        "thought_text": "Re-evaluate the trajectory calculation. Ensure that the quadratic equation used to determine the time of collision is correctly formulated, considering both the linear and angular motion of the cookie's corners.",
